# Tuent Core

Framework: `Assets/TuentCore/` — namespace `Tuent.Core`, `Tuent.Core.UI`.

| Cần | Dùng |
|---|---|
| Log | `TLogger` — không `Debug.Log` trong feature |
| Singleton Mono | `MonoSingleton<T>` |
| Pool | `TPool`, `TPoolers` |
| UI | `UIScreen`, `UIPopup`, `ScreenData`, `PopupData` |
| Save | `BaseDataSave<T>`, `LocalStorageUtils` |
| Audio | `AudioManager`, `AudioDatabase` |

Code game mới → `_MainProject`, namespace riêng (`Gameplay.*`).
